cff-version: 1.2.0
title: droidspaces-gpu — real Adreno GPU access from a Droidspaces Ubuntu rootfs via turnip + kgsl
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: ZxAlif-ID
    website: 'https://github.com/ZxAlif-ID'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/ZxAlif-ID/droidspaces-gpu'
abstract: >-
  Tools and documentation for using a mobile Qualcomm Adreno GPU
  (KGSL kernel interface) from inside a Droidspaces / proot Ubuntu
  aarch64 rootfs, using Mesa's turnip Vulkan driver with a glibc
  compatibility shim, a patched ICD, a modern glslang build, and a
  minimal verified Vulkan compute demo.
keywords:
  - adreno
  - turnip
  - vulkan
  - kgsl
  - droidspaces
  - android
  - ubuntu
  - proot
license: MIT
version: v1.0.0
date-released: '2026-09-12'
